{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"0abaa6d14f31d26c","name":"card_unit_101st_bezhitsa","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Soviet/CovertOp/units/card_unit_101st_bezhitsa","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"101st BEZHITSA","text":"At the start of your turn, your units get +2 attack and you lose 2 kredits.","flavorText":"The 101st Rifle Regiment was a unit of the 4th Rifle Division of the Soviet Red Army. The division was formed in 1919 during the Russian Civil war, and in 1921 it fought in the Polish-Soviet war. In 1939 the 4th Division fought in the Winter War, notably at the Battle of Kelja. In 1942 it became part of the 12th Army and participated in the Battle of the Caucasus, but after heavy losses it was disbanded. The division was formed again in 1943, and as part of the 69th Army, it took part in numerous battles and operations, such as the Bryansk Offensive, the Lublin-Brest Offensive, the Warsaw-Poznan Offensive, and finally in the Berlin Offensive. In 1945 the name of \"Bezhitsa\" was inscribed on the divisional banner for the division's participation in the Bryansk Offensive in 1943.","faction":"Soviet","type":"infantry","rarity":"Unique","cost":3,"operationCost":1,"attack":3,"defense":6},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_101st_bezhitsa","title":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_101st_bezhitsa_title","SourceString":"101st BEZHITSA","LocalizedString":"101st BEZHITSA"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":3,"defense":6,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Soviet","kredits":3,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_101st_bezhitsa_text","SourceString":"At the start of your turn, your units get +2 attack and you lose 2 kredits.","LocalizedString":"At the start of your turn, your units get +2 attack and you lose 2 kredits."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_101st_bezhitsa_history","SourceString":"The 101st Rifle Regiment was a unit of the 4th Rifle Division of the Soviet Red Army. The division was formed in 1919 during the Russian Civil war, and in 1921 it fought in the Polish-Soviet war. In 1939 the 4th Division fought in the Winter War, notably at the Battle of Kelja. In 1942 it became part of the 12th Army and participated in the Battle of the Caucasus, but after heavy losses it was disbanded. The division was formed again in 1943, and as part of the 69th Army, it took part in numerous battles and operations, such as the Bryansk Offensive, the Lublin-Brest Offensive, the Warsaw-Poznan Offensive, and finally in the Berlin Offensive. In 1945 the name of \"Bezhitsa\" was inscribed on the divisional banner for the division's participation in the Bryansk Offensive in 1943.","LocalizedString":"The 101st Rifle Regiment was a unit of the 4th Rifle Division of the Soviet Red Army. The division was formed in 1919 during the Russian Civil war, and in 1921 it fought in the Polish-Soviet war. In 1939 the 4th Division fought in the Winter War, notably at the Battle of Kelja. In 1942 it became part of the 12th Army and participated in the Battle of the Caucasus, but after heavy losses it was disbanded. The division was formed again in 1943, and as part of the 69th Army, it took part in numerous battles and operations, such as the Bryansk Offensive, the Lublin-Brest Offensive, the Warsaw-Poznan Offensive, and finally in the Berlin Offensive. In 1945 the name of \"Bezhitsa\" was inscribed on the divisional banner for the division's participation in the Bryansk Offensive in 1943."},"operationCost":1,"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Unique","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::CurrentExpansion","EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Trigger","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnStartofTurn"],"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes":["EHelpBubbleTypes::Covert","EHelpBubbleTypes::Trigger","EHelpBubbleTypes::Guard","EHelpBubbleTypes::Fight"],"hasGuard":true,"hasCovert":true,"Image":{"AssetPathName":"/Game/Assets/Textures/Images/Soviet/CandidateArtwork/Summer_24/t_101st_bezhitsa_01.t_101st_be